      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROWNIE POINTS (6) was below best at his last start when 7th at this track following a second place finish (30.70) there two back. Should bounce back. URBAN SURF (4) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (30.61) at this track in a Maiden over 520m. The form out of last race has been strong. Can measure up. ASTON LOUISE (1) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 4 lengths (24.36) at Bendigo in a Maiden over 425m. Overdue and expected to feature again. SONIC SYDNEY (7) makes debut for the Rod Noden kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can feature with the right run.",
